{"id":"n29033-1-9","stage":2,"title":"색다르다 · 与众不同","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n29033-1-9-1","ko":"맛이 어때요?","zh":"味道怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"맛이","meaning":"味，味道","explanation":"맛：味，味道；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"맛","audio":"/audio/2bc64d401ca15bdf9987.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66228","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어때요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2bc64d401ca15bdf","term":"맛","zh":"味，味道","audio":"/audio/2bc64d401ca15bdf9987.mp3","entryId":"66228","definition":"用舌头接触食物等时得到的感觉。","pronunciation":["맏"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/85bf3f596725e125c3b3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n29033-1-9-2","ko":"이전에는 맛을 본 적이 없는 색다른 맛이네요.","zh":"这是以前从未尝过、非常独特的味道呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이전에는","meaning":"以前，之前","explanation":"이전：以前，之前；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"이전","audio":"/audio/da7e61c67cc5a90f0630.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70752","senseId":"1","lemma":"이전","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"맛을","meaning":"味，味道","explanation":"맛：味，味道；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"맛","audio":"/audio/2bc64d401ca15bdf9987.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66228","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"본","meaning":"尝","explanation":"보다：尝；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"8","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"적이","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"적：时，时候；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"적","audio":"/audio/137f8ca799a5827448b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71232","senseId":"1","lemma":"적","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"없는","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"1","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"색다른","meaning":"与众不同，新奇","explanation":"색다르다：与众不同，新奇；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"색다르다","audio":"/audio/a191a18d8d53cb472f2e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29033","senseId":"1","lemma":"색다르다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"맛이네요.","meaning":"味，味道","explanation":"맛：味，味道；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"맛","audio":"/audio/2bc64d401ca15bdf9987.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66228","senseId":"1","lemma":"맛","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"da7e61c67cc5a90f","term":"이전","zh":"以前，之前","audio":"/audio/da7e61c67cc5a90f0630.mp3","entryId":"70752","definition":"比现在往前。","pronunciation":["이ː전"]},{"id":"2bc64d401ca15bdf","term":"맛","zh":"味，味道","audio":"/audio/2bc64d401ca15bdf9987.mp3","entryId":"66228","definition":"用舌头接触食物等时得到的感觉。","pronunciation":["맏"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"尝","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"为了辨别食物的味道而稍微吃点。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"137f8ca799a58274","term":"적","zh":"时，时候","audio":"/audio/137f8ca799a5827448b3.mp3","entryId":"71232","definition":"进行某事或出现其状态的时候；或过去某个时间。","pronunciation":["적"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없다","zh":"没有","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3","entryId":"89917","definition":"人或事物等实际上不存在。","pronunciation":["업ː따"]},{"id":"a191a18d8d53cb47","term":"색다르다","zh":"与众不同，新奇","audio":"/audio/a191a18d8d53cb472f2e.mp3","entryId":"29033","definition":"与普通的不一样，有特色。","pronunciation":["색따르다"]}],"audio":"/aud